cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Research prototype. Not a cryptocurrency; no security claim."
title: "Radix: a post-quantum privacy-preserving payment protocol (research prototype)"
abstract: >-
  A reference implementation in Python of the SMILE lattice ring signature with set
  membership (ePrint 2021/564), a same-witness linkable tag, a local testnet, and a
  Rust implementation of the prover and verifier that is cross-verified against the
  Python reference in both directions. Not audited, not deployed, no value.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
authors:
